      "worked": "Activation requires $|t-70|>5$. Since $t=\\frac{2S+175}{3}$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\left|\\frac{2S+175}{3}-70\\right|&>5\\\\\\left|\\frac{2S-35}{3}\\right|&>5\\\\|2S-35|&>15\\\\2S-35&<-15\\quad\\text{or}\\quad2S-35>15\\\\S&<10\\quad\\text{or}\\quad S>25.\\end{align*}$$\nThe endpoints are excluded because activation requires a deviation of more than $5\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$.",
